## Free License

Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person or organization
with **fewer than 25 developers** to use, copy, modify, merge, publish,
distribute, and/or sublicense copies of the Software, subject to the
conditions below.

A "developer" means any individual who writes, reviews, tests, or deploys
code as part of their work for the organization, whether employee or
independent contractor. The 25-developer threshold is measured across the
entire organization and all its affiliates.

---

## Commercial License

Organizations with **25 or more developers** must purchase a commercial
license. The fee is flat per organization — not per developer, not per seat.

| Developers in organization | Annual license fee (EUR) |
|---|---|
| < 25 | Free |
| 25 – 74 | €150 |
| 75 – 199 | €350 |
| 200 – 499 | €600 |
| 500+ | Contact for pricing |

Commercial licenses grant the same rights as the Free License. A commercial
license does **not** include support, SLAs, warranties, or additional
obligations from the Licensor.

### Renewal

Licenses are billed annually and **renew automatically each year** on the
anniversary of purchase. You may cancel the renewal at any time before the
next billing date; upon cancellation the license remains valid until the
end of the current paid period.

### Tier changes

It is your sole responsibility to purchase the correct tier based on your
organization's developer count. If your headcount changes and you cross
into a new tier before the start of the next renewal period, you must
purchase the appropriate license. The Licensor is not required to notify
you, prorate, or downgrade your license mid-period.

### No refunds

**All payments are final.** No refunds, full or prorated, will be issued
under any circumstances — including but not limited to: you stop using the
Software, your developer count decreases, or you cancel the renewal before
the period ends.

If you are a consumer in the European Union, you acknowledge that the
Software is digital content delivered immediately upon purchase and that
you expressly waive your 14-day right of withdrawal under Article 16(m) of
Directive 2011/83/EU.

To purchase: the Licensor provides payment links at the project website.
For alternate payment methods or the 500+ tier, contact vinciarellifranco@gmail.com.

